paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{l}
  {S = {\int_{0}^{\pi}{2\pi r\sin t\sqrt{{( - r\sin t)}^{2} + {({r\cos t})}^{2}}dt}}} \\
  {\phantom{S} = 2\pi{\int_{0}^{\pi}{r\sin t\sqrt{r^{2}‍(\sin^{2}t + \cos^{2}t)}dt}} = 2\pi{\int_{0}^{\pi}{r\sin t \cdot rdt}}} \\
  {\phantom{S} = 2\pi r^{2}{\int_{0}^{\pi}{\sin tdt}} = 2\pi r^{2}( - \cos t)\rbrack_{0}^{\pi} = 4\pi r^{2}}
  \end{array}$$
